History :
NastyWall 1.3 - Added optional anonymous option,anonymous entries will be
                added to the callers log so the sysop can see who written
                what.
                Added optional colour cans
                Removed the internal cans text and Added a new file
                "VN_Wall.Cans" so you can draw your own cans if anyone can
                do better spray cans than the ones i have done then please
                call G.B.H. and upload them to me -Thanks-
                Made the display area work ok for PC users with only 23 lines
                now screens with ONLY 200 pixels will display ok.
                PC's suck!  & ST's Suck even more.
                Now Multinode Freindly.  Will not allow a user to start to
                write on the wall if somebody else is writing.
